  "description": "Use this version for Asp.Net projects. Dump out all your .Net Core and ASP.Net Core config on startup, together with the configuration provider source that value came from. Ideal for troubleshooting when overriding values via environment variables in containerized environments such as Azure, Amazon AWS and Rancher. Enabled with simple services.AddConfigDump() call at the end of your ConfigureServices() method. Uses any configured ILogger.",
